+-+| | px |
+-+|---|---|
+-+| Old `MatchdayIQ` | **105** |
+-+| New `MatchdayPilot` | **124** |
+-+| Growth from the rename | **+19** |
+-+| Space before `.header-actions` | **164** |
+-+| **Clearance remaining** | **40** |
